---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---

<Section
  id="about"
  title="About"
  subtitle="I'm a Senior Software Engineer with 5+ years of experience building and modernizing enterprise web platforms."
>
  <div class="card">
    <p>
      My deepest expertise is in React and TypeScript, complemented by hands-on
      work with Node.js services, GraphQL middleware, authentication, backend
      integrations, data workflows, and cloud deployments.
    </p>
    <p>
      I've owned micro-frontend architecture, built reusable product modules,
      orchestrated backend services through GraphQL, integrated platforms
      including ServiceNow, Power BI, and DocuSign, supported Azure Data Factory
      pipelines, and led cross-functional engineering teams.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside enterprise work, I build and operate full-stack products using
      Next.js, PostgreSQL, Drizzle ORM, Docker, Caddy, Linux, and Oracle Cloud.
    </p>

    <p>
      Currently, I'm building a GenAI-powered IRCC Express Entry application
      helper inspired by my own PR journey. The platform uses AI to analyze
      user-uploaded documents, generate structured Proof of Work/Education PDFs,
      combine and format supporting files, and automatically draft personalized
      Letters of Explanation to simplify the immigration application process.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>
